    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d451">

                <pb facs="0473" n="375" sameAs="frus:frus1930v02/pg375"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.003/271</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Acting Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-02-06">February 6, 1930</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Japanese Ambassador came in today and left the attached note.<anchor n="61"
                        xml:id="d451-f1"/> He states this is a statement without reservation of the
                    Japanese position as to extraterritoriality and he invites a similar statement
                    of the American position if we can give it to him. I told him I would answer
                    him.</p>
                <closer><signed>J[<hi rendition="#small-caps">oseph</hi>] P. C[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">otton</hi>]</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
